{
  "id": "builtin-find-clay-users",
  "name": "Find companies using Clay",
  "kind": "table",
  "definition": {
    "columns": [
      { "name": "Company", "kind": "input", "type": "text" },
      { "name": "Domain", "kind": "input", "type": "text" },
      {
        "name": "Clay research",
        "kind": "agent",
        "type": "text",
        "config": {
          "provider": "openai",
          "prompt": "Research whether {{Company}} ({{Domain}}) uses Clay.com (the GTM data enrichment / outbound automation tool, clay.com) internally for sales, marketing, RevOps or GTM engineering.\nFirst call fetch_page on https://www.clay.com/customers/{{company slug}} (lowercase company name, spaces→hyphens, e.g. open-ai, vanta, rippling) — if it returns a real customer story mentioning the company, that is definitive evidence (uses_clay=yes, evidence_type=case_study, evidence_url=that page). If that page is missing/404/generic, then use web_search with these queries: \"{{Company}}\" clay.com; \"{{Company}}\" \"Clay\" GTM engineer job; site:linkedin.com \"{{Company}}\" \"Clay\" outbound; \"{{Company}}\" clay.com case study; site:g2.com clay \"{{Company}}\". Use fetch_page to confirm the strongest hit. Ignore unrelated meanings of 'clay' (pottery, Clay County, people named Clay).\nFinish with fields: uses_clay (\"yes\" | \"likely\" | \"no\" | \"unknown\"), evidence_url (the single best URL or \"\"), evidence_quote (short verbatim quote proving it, or \"\"), evidence_type (\"case_study\" | \"job_posting\" | \"review\" | \"social_post\" | \"agency\" | \"other\"), confidence (0-1 number). answer = one sentence summary."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "Uses Clay?",
        "kind": "formula",
        "type": "text",
        "config": { "expression": "get({{Clay research}}, \"fields.uses_clay\")" }
      },
      {
        "name": "Evidence URL",
        "kind": "formula",
        "type": "url",
        "config": { "expression": "get({{Clay research}}, \"fields.evidence_url\")" }
      },
      {
        "name": "Confidence",
        "kind": "formula",
        "type": "number",
        "config": { "expression": "get({{Clay research}}, \"fields.confidence\")" }
      },
      {
        "name": "Evidence",
        "kind": "formula",
        "type": "text",
        "config": { "expression": "get({{Clay research}}, \"fields.evidence_quote\")" }
      }
    ],
    "rows": [
      { "Company": "Anthropic", "Domain": "anthropic.com" },
      { "Company": "OpenAI", "Domain": "openai.com" },
      { "Company": "Vanta", "Domain": "vanta.com" },
